data: {"id": "ccc38d80d9764419-thinking-parallel_evidence-582", "run_id": "ccc38d80d9764419", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1. **Pod 生命周期**: `aiops-case-v05/workload` (UID `b9e687f5-702b-4d01-bfb9-2df4ff23ba91`) 调度到 `node2`，状态为 **Pending / ContainerCreating**，容器 `app` 从未启动过（Restart Count = 0）。\n\n2. **Kubernetes Events — 关键证据**:\n   - **`FailedMount` (x15 over 14m)**: `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key`\n   - **`FailedMount` (x6 over 12m)**: `Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input], unattached volumes=[input]: timed o", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789122653565, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

