data: {"id": "ccc38d80d9764419-final", "run_id": "ccc38d80d9764419", "seq": 587, "ts_ms": 1789122667186, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v05/workload` | ContainerCreating | Volume 'input' references a ConfigMap key ('unavailable-key') that does not exist in ConfigMap 'workload-input', causing MountVolume.SetUp to fail and preventing the container from starting. |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | fact-f32b4de5fd61 | MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key | 明确指出挂载失败机制：ConfigMap 键不存在 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | fact-2f0465cd2ceb | FailedMount (x15 over 14m) - Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input] | 证实挂载失败为持续异常行为，时间跨度超过 14 分钟 |\n| 3 | K8s State | fact-66e07968029e | pod.status = Pending | 定义 Pod 当前因挂载失败导致的终止状态 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | fact-2f99fc258bfb | container.restart_count = 0 | 排除因容器运行崩溃导致重启的可能，佐证启动过程卡在挂载阶段 |\n| 5 | Metric | fact-54a20d2ce8b7 | waiting_reason = \"ContainerCreating\" | 量化确认容器等待原因，与 K8s 事件状态一致 |\n\n**证据印证说明：**\nKubernetes 事件（1, 2）直接揭示了“ConfigMap key 不存在”这一具体错误原因，导致 `MountVolume.SetUp` 失败。这种挂载失败直接导致了 Pod 状态停滞在 Pending（3），且由于挂载失败，容器无法启动进入运行状态，因此重启计数保持为 0（4），且 Metric 显示原因持续为 ContainerCreating（5）。各维度证据逻辑闭环，无冲突。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'workload-input' 缺少键 'unavailable-key' → MountVolume.SetUp 失败 → Pod 状态 Pending → 容器无法启动 (ContainerCreating)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为：**Pod `aiops-case-v05/workload` 的卷挂载配置错误**。具体而言，其 Volume `input` 引用了 ConfigMap `workload-input` 中的键 `unavailable-key`，但该键在 ConfigMap 中实际并不存在，导致挂载过程失败，进而使 Pod 永远处于 Pending 状态，容器无法启动。该结论由 K8s Event 事实 `fact-f32b4de5fd61` 及 Pod 状态事实 `fact-66e07968029e` 强支持。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 58.4s\n├─ 问题定位: 17.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 33.0s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v05/workload: 33.0s (Evidence 27.9s, RCA 5.0s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v05/workload**: pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 58.444, "metrics": {"run_id": "ccc38d80d9764419", "mttr": {"value": "58.4s", "seconds": 58.449952840805054, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-imagepull-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 58449.952840805054, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 55001.67012214661, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 14, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 8758.991956710815, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2976.044178009033}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "d